  "notes": "NVIDIA presents it as part of the Nemotron 3 family (the developer blog calls it the smallest member); its version number is 3.5 and it opens the Lightning name. It has the same 30B-A3B size class as Nemotron 3 Nano, but no NVIDIA source says it was built from that model; the model card describes NVFP4 pre-training on more than 20T tokens, so no derived-from relation is recorded. The successor-of link rests on the launch post's wording that the release follows Nemotron 3 Nano. The API id nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b is the build.nvidia.com model path linked from the model card. NVIDIA says the Nemotron Coalition contributed evaluation methods, inference software and datasets."
